      "date": "1972-09-07",
      "kind": "planning decision",
      "description": "Before the present building, the irregular parcel of about 65,160 square feet, with frontage on Third Street and Custer Avenue, was in use for automobile wrecking and used-car sales. The City Planning Commission approved, with fifteen conditions, automobile wrecking in an open yard on the site.",
